End-to-End-ETL-Pipeline-Using-Python-MySQL-and-Apache-Airflow

-- Developed a Python-based ETL pipeline to extract employee records from MYSQL.
-- Implemented data cleaning and transformation using Pandas.
-- Loaded processed records into the target database.
-- Created an Airflow DAG to automate and orchestrate ETL execution
-- Configured task dependencies and monitored pipeline execution through the Airflow UI.
